Expansion: Build every Focus Level as a verified session.
Level	Carrier
Focus 10	200 Hz
Focus 12	280 Hz
Focus 15	200 Hz
Focus 21	180 Hz
Each session: multi-phase arc, verified output, aligned visuals (dark room, slow pulse), downloadable WAV.
Why it's visionary: Monroe Institute charges $500+ for their Hemi-Sync CDs. This is free, verified, customizable, and API-accessible. The Monroe community (r/gatewaytapes has 50K+ members) would adopt it immediately.
